## Residual risks

1. FieldProjectionService is seeded with hardcoded field id "app.elevation-m". This matches the default WorldRuntime catalog, but if the catalog seed changes the projection may show empty values. This is acceptable for Task 9; a dynamic field-id discovery can be added later.
2. ImmediateMainThreadDispatcher runs command handlers inline. A future Godot-specific dispatcher can be introduced without changing registration wiring.
3. Registry-registered IDisposable services (Command service, Projection service, World service) are not explicitly disposed on shutdown; this follows existing Host.cs disposal pattern and is consistent with pre-Task-9 services.

